---
// Fig. for "Information Theory & Entropy": the simulation argument behind
// zero-knowledge. Real proof shown first (left, uses the actual secret x —
// green), simulated proof second (right, built backwards with no secret —
// blue/public), matching this lesson's left-to-right reveal order.
---
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 560" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;">
  <text x="380" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="16" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">simulating a proof without the secret</text>
  <text x="380" y="48" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">public: G and y = x&#183;G. The prover claims to know x.</text>

  <line x1="380" y1="66" x2="380" y2="414" stroke="#223049" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 5" />

  <!-- real proof: left, shown first, uses the actual secret x -->
  <text x="190" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="14" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">REAL PROOF</text>
  <text x="190" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">(prover knows x)</text>

  <text x="190" y="134" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">pick a random r</text>
  <line x1="190" y1="142" x2="190" y2="166" stroke="#5ddc8a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-g)" />
  <text x="190" y="184" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">send a = r&#183;G</text>
  <line x1="190" y1="192" x2="190" y2="214" stroke="#5ddc8a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-g)" />
  <text x="190" y="232" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">receive a random challenge c</text>
  <line x1="190" y1="240" x2="190" y2="262" stroke="#5ddc8a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-g)" />
  <text x="190" y="280" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">reply z = r + c&#183;x</text>
  <line x1="190" y1="290" x2="190" y2="328" stroke="#5ddc8a" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-g)" />

  <rect x="90" y="330" width="200" height="46" rx="9" fill="#0d1526" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.6" />
  <text x="190" y="358" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">transcript (a, c, z)</text>
  <text x="190" y="398" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">check: z&#183;G = a + c&#183;y &#10003;</text>

  <!-- simulated proof: right, shown second, no secret used -->
  <text x="570" y="88" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="14" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">SIMULATED PROOF</text>
  <text x="570" y="104" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="11" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">(nobody knows x)</text>

  <text x="570" y="134" text-anchor="middle" fill="#e9eef5" font-size="13" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">pick a random c and a random z</text>
  <line x1="570" y1="144" x2="570" y2="206" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-b)" />
  <text x="636" y="168" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="10.5" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">challenge chosen first,</text>
  <text x="636" y="183" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="10.5" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">then work backwards</text>
  <text x="570" y="224" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">compute a = z&#183;G &#8211; c&#183;y</text>
  <text x="570" y="242" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="10.5" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">(x is never used)</text>
  <line x1="570" y1="250" x2="570" y2="328" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#sa-arrow-b)" />

  <rect x="470" y="330" width="200" height="46" rx="9" fill="#0d1526" stroke="#8fdcff" stroke-width="1.6" />
  <text x="570" y="358" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="13.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">transcript (a, c, z)</text>
  <text x="570" y="398" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5ddc8a" font-size="12.5" font-weight="700" font-family="SF Mono, Fira Code, Consolas, monospace">check: z&#183;G = a + c&#183;y &#10003;</text>

  <text x="380" y="424" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-style="italic" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">the two transcripts look identical</text>

  <line x1="40" y1="442" x2="720" y2="442" stroke="#223049" stroke-width="1" />
  <text x="380" y="466" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="15" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">IF YOU CAN FAKE IT WITHOUT THE SECRET,</text>
  <text x="380" y="486" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8fdcff" font-size="15" font-weight="800" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">IT CAN'T LEAK THE SECRET</text>
  <text x="380" y="508" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">That is the formal meaning of zero-knowledge: whatever the verifier sees,</text>
  <text x="380" y="526" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b96a8" font-size="12.5" font-family="-apple-system,Arial,sans-serif">they could have generated on their own.</text>

  <defs>
    <marker id="sa-arrow-g" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#5ddc8a" />
    </marker>
    <marker id="sa-arrow-b" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
      <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#8fdcff" />
    </marker>
  </defs>
</svg>
